// Math functions
//
// Scalar math (no tensor needed):
//   abs(x)    — absolute value
//   sqrt(x)   — square root
//   pow(b, e) — b^e (planned builtin)
//   ln(x)     — natural log (planned builtin)
//   sin/cos   — trigonometry (planned builtins)
//
// Tensor math (available as tensor methods):
//   x.abs(), x.sqrt(), x.exp(), x.log()
//   x.relu(), x.sigmoid(), x.tanh(), x.softmax()
//
// Reductions:
//   x.sum(), x.mean(), x.sum_axis(axis)
//
// Linear algebra:
//   x.matmul(y), x.transpose()
